    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11452" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Crantor</span></b> , ŏris,
		m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κράντωρ</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In fable, <i>the
				armor-bearer of Peleus, slain by the centaur Demoleon</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Ov.
				M. 12, 367</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A distinguished Grecian philosopher of the old
				Academic school</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Ac. 1, 9,
			34</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 44, 135</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Fin. 5,
				3, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Tusc. 1, 48, 115</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 2, 4 al.</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
